{"seq":3,"slug":"supplier-collab-score","title":"供应商协同绩效评分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/supplier-demand-forecast-collaboration/collab-performance/supplier-collab-score","wordCount":1960,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"供应商协同绩效评分\">供应商协同绩效评分</h1><p>前三章沉淀下来的行为数据——承诺达成率、预测回应及时性、异常响应速度、协同后的指标改善——单看每一条都只是一段流水，合起来才构成对一家供应商协同能力的判断。评分要做的就是这个合并，但它的用途不是给供应商贴标签：分数真正的用途是<strong>决定下一轮协同的深度</strong>。分数高的可以进入更深的协同模式（更细的预测粒度、更长的提前共享、甚至是 VMI 水位自主决定），分数低的先退回基础的预测—确认模式。闭环由此合上，回到第一章那张分解粒度表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么不能只有一个分\">核心概念：为什么不能只有一个分</h2><p>供应商评价在业界有很长的历史，一般认为它评估的是「供应商的能力与绩效」，常用工具从简单的电子表格到完整的供应商关系管理系统都有，评估维度涵盖产能、财务、质量保证、组织结构与流程、以及绩效（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vendor_rating\">Supplier evaluation</a>）。一个值得注意的事实是：该文献明确指出<strong>没有标准的加权公式</strong>，唯一被反复确认为普遍使用的是质量与交付两项，其余如成本、灵活性、沟通都属于 Ray Carter 的 10Cs 模型范畴，权重由使用方自定。</p>\n<p>这条事实对系统设计有直接含义：评分模型的权重必须是<strong>配置项</strong>，而不是写死在代码里的常量。不同的品类、不同的协同目标（保供 vs 降本）对应的权重完全不同，把权重固化下来等于把一个商务决策偷偷塞进代码。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评分维度</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>反映什么</th>\n<th>谁更该关心</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>承诺达成率</td>\n<td>承诺回传（2.2）</td>\n<td>答应的能不能做到</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测回应质量</td>\n<td>预测确认与异议</td>\n<td>是否认真读预测</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应及时性</td>\n<td>建议确认/异常响应时长</td>\n<td>协同的执行速度</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指标改善</td>\n<td>缺货率/周转变化（4.2）</td>\n<td>协同是否产生实效</td>\n<td>双方</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据质量</td>\n<td>在途/库存上报准确度</td>\n<td>对方能否被信任</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水位遵守（VMI）</td>\n<td>min/max 违反次数（2.3）</td>\n<td>自主决策是否可控</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分维度定义与计算\">分维度定义与计算</h2><h3 id=\"承诺达成率\">承诺达成率</h3><p>最核心的一项。定义要避免两个陷阱：一是把「全额承诺」当分子会让小批量料号天然占优，二是把交期顺延完全忽略会漏掉实际影响。务实的定义是数量与时间的加权。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>CommitFill</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>committed</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>suggested</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mtext>suggested</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>OnTimePct</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>承诺交期不晚于建议交期的行数</mtext><mtext>总承诺行数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CommitFill} = \\frac{\\sum_i \\min(\\text{committed}_i, \\text{suggested}_i)}{\\sum_i \\text{suggested}_i}, \\qquad \\text{OnTimePct} = \\frac{\\text{承诺交期不晚于建议交期的行数}}{\\text{总承诺行数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CommitFill</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4254em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">suggested</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">committed</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">suggested</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OnTimePct</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总承诺行数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">承诺交期不晚于建议交期的行数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两个数字分别给，不合成——一个供应商数量全给但交期总是晚两周，与数量打八折但交期准，是两种不同的合作模式，合成的单一分数会把这个区别抹掉。</p>\n<h3 id=\"响应及时性\">响应及时性</h3><p>从建议发出到供应商确认（或拒绝）的时长。用中位数而不是平均值，因为少数极端案例（节假日、对接人休假）会把平均值拉得毫无代表性。响应期超过约定时长的行记为超期，超期率单独作为一个惩罚项——它不是能力问题，是流程问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据质量\">数据质量</h3><p>这一项最容易被忽略，但它是所有其他指标的地基。供应商上报的在途与库存如果长期与平台观测对不上（<a href=\"../collab-dashboard-visibility/shared-inventory-visibility\">联合库存与在途可见</a>里的差异清单），那么平台侧所有的覆盖天数与预警都是建在沙子上。用差异率作为度量：日均差异量 / 日均在途量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 供应商协同绩效底表：每个维度算一个原始值，不做加权&#10;CREATE MATERIALIZED VIEW supplier_collab_metrics AS&#10;WITH commit AS (&#10;  SELECT supplier_id,&#10;         sum(least(committed_qty, suggested_qty)) / nullif(sum(suggested_qty), 0) AS commit_fill,&#10;         avg(CASE WHEN latest_committed_due &lt;= suggested_due_date THEN 1.0 ELSE 0.0 END) AS on_time_pct&#10;  FROM commitment_variance&#10;  WHERE created_at &gt;= now() - INTERVAL &#39;90 days&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY supplier_id&#10;),&#10;resp AS (&#10;  SELECT supplier_id,&#10;         percentile_cont(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY ack_hours) AS ack_median_hours,&#10;         avg(CASE WHEN ack_hours &gt; sla_hours THEN 1.0 ELSE 0.0 END)   AS ack_overdue_pct&#10;  FROM suggestion_response_time&#10;  WHERE issued_at &gt;= now() - INTERVAL &#39;90 days&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY supplier_id&#10;),&#10;dataq AS (&#10;  SELECT supplier_id,&#10;         avg(abs(gap)) / nullif(avg(platform_side), 0) AS transit_gap_ratio&#10;  FROM transit_reconciliation&#10;  WHERE stat_date &gt;= current_date - 90&#10;  GROUP BY supplier_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT c.supplier_id, c.commit_fill, c.on_time_pct,&#10;       r.ack_median_hours, r.ack_overdue_pct,&#10;       d.transit_gap_ratio&#10;FROM commit c&#10;LEFT JOIN resp  r ON r.supplier_id = c.supplier_id&#10;LEFT JOIN dataq d ON d.supplier_id = c.supplier_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 供应商协同绩效底表：每个维度算一个原始值，不做加权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MATERIALIZED VIEW supplier_collab_metrics </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> commit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> supplier_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">least</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(committed_qty, suggested_qty)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(suggested_qty), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> commit_fill,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> latest_committed_due </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> suggested_due_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> on_time_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> commitment_variance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\